  "description": "Bonita is a pharmacist who works with rare ingredients that require foraging in dangerous places. She hires Ivan for a short-term contract as her bodyguard, but things take a turn on their first day when he is dosed with one of Bonita’s ingredients, which happens to be an aphrodisiac. Determined to help Ivan out of his hard circumstances, Bonita takes a heated approach to give him a hand. From there, coincidences keep leading to sexy encounters between them. Will this be a fling that lasts only until the end of their contract, or will this become something more?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
